Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:12:34 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Unzoom instead of cycling panes while the tab is zoomed

cycle_pane_next and cycle_pane_previous used to move focus to the next
pane while keeping the tab zoomed, so the zoom jumped to a pane that was
hidden a moment ago. While the focused tab is zoomed they now only turn
the zoom off, leaving focus on the zoomed pane; once the panes are back
on screen, the same key cycles them as before.
